OL,3,GNEWSAStudents must adapt to AI, says
OL,4,Aeducation boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents will need to adapt to changing
OL,7,Femployer demands due to new technology
OL,8,Fand artificial intelligence (AI), an
OL,9,Feducation leader has said.
OL,11,FThe Guernsey Institute (TGI) has
OL,12,Flaunched a survey asking employers what
OL,13,Fskills they expect employees to need in
OL,14,Fthe future.
OL,16,FExecutive principal Dr Louise Misselke
OL,17,Fsaid it was the first survey of its
OL,18,Fkind for 12 years and she foreshadowed
OL,19,FAI would play a big part of the
OL,20,Fresponses.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
