OL,3,GNEWSAStudents must adapt to AI, says
OL,4,Aeducation boss
OL,5,
OL,6,F"People will need to change and adapt
OL,7,Fand upskill and retrain, but I actually
OL,8,Fthink there's a lot of opportunity in
OL,9,Fthose changes," she said.
